1
00:00:00,855 --> 00:00:04,725
(Howard:)So, what are we gonna
name this kid?

2
00:00:04,726 --> 00:00:06,596
(Howard:)Now that we know
she's a girl,

3
00:00:06,594 --> 00:00:10,094
(Howard:)it kind of ruins my plan
for Wally Wolowitz.

4
00:00:11,366 --> 00:00:13,496
(Bernadette:)Could name her
after your mom.

5
00:00:13,501 --> 00:00:14,631
(Howard:)Debbie?

6
00:00:14,636 --> 00:00:16,106
(Bernadette:)No.

7
00:00:16,104 --> 00:00:17,904
(Howard:)She hated that name.

8
00:00:17,906 --> 00:00:19,506
(Bernadette:)Did she have a middle name?

9
00:00:19,507 --> 00:00:21,177
(Howard:)Melvina.

10
00:00:22,477 --> 00:00:25,577
(Bernadette:)Let's keep thinking.

11
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:28,280
(Midwife:)Mm.
Ah.

12
00:00:28,283 --> 00:00:30,813
(Howard:)It sucks that
she's not here.

13
00:00:30,819 --> 00:00:32,419
(Howard:)I know.

14
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,720
(Howard:)Hm.

15
00:00:33,721 --> 00:00:36,961
(Howard:)She would've been
the best grandma.

16
00:00:36,958 --> 00:00:39,088
(Bernadette:)She did always have candy
in her pocket.

17
00:00:39,093 --> 00:00:40,893
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

18
00:00:40,895 --> 00:00:43,565
(Howard:)I was 20 years old
before I figured out

19
00:00:43,565 --> 00:00:46,835
(Howard:)Tootsie Rolls weren't
naturally warm.

20
00:00:47,969 --> 00:00:50,539
(Bernadette:)I didn't know her
five minutes and she asked,

21
00:00:50,538 --> 00:00:54,678
“Are you a Milky Way
or a Snickers girl?”

22
00:00:54,676 --> 00:01:01,026
(Howard:)Thank God you answered right,
we wouldn't be here today.

